                <pb facs="0296" n="198" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg198"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August 26,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee states that Mr. Rockhill was appointed, while Mr. Conger was
                    inaccessible, as special agent to examine and report on situation. He will reach
                    Pekin shortly. Instructs to confer fully with him, and make joint recommendation
                    as to action now and for the future.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
